{"id":275781332,"title":"248.二进制-Buffer底层存储-Node中流Stream的使用","summary":"Node类-二进制的学习和Buffer底层存储（理解）对于我们计算机来说一个字节可以表示最多的的是256个。","content":"<p>Node类-二进制的学习和Buffer底层存储（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782822109912-3753c4f7-4028-4fb1-bc3b-ffe3e0ae972d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782822929038-5c013017-defc-4aff-b628-ab37fbf87153.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>对于我们计算机来说一个字节可以表示最多的的是256个。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782823085227-aea85f2b-8e5c-4ef9-81df-c870ca426fde.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782823259042-b7b8fcf6-9557-48ca-b439-7f56a39fce1c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node类-Buffer和字符串之间的转换（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p>每一个中文要用3个字节来表示</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782823714792-7f030828-1b47-41b3-a51e-c96d6858b044.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782823786958-90924bad-0740-4e63-8b3c-cbec622b5069.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782823818166-cc98343f-5b95-4e77-b508-44cbf1ad8cd1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>将编码转换回来</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782823842353-1ca46c61-93ff-430d-a55f-6da2f6fc8f32.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要注意编码和解码的一个格式<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782824022261-cd9d250f-0260-43dc-9b6b-47aa505b2f24.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node类-Buffer其他的创建方式和读取文件（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782824341218-87b5ae6b-dcb9-464d-a242-91076b180b17.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782824369432-e85a76c7-c36b-49d9-ab3e-8474f70aa96c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782824569924-1cd92d00-768a-4c8f-b4e0-ce63755f9013.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>从文件那里读取Buffer</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782824652584-0dc8af92-c4c9-4a72-bca5-dc0e8cc967cb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782824784008-69d3e0e1-d32d-4c2f-b306-d9e9163c9480.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>读取图片的二进制<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782825034098-d3ff22fa-f018-4b7a-9972-f7888d297531.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node类-Buffer的创建源码和原理分析（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">了解</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782825324891-f7335b9e-68a8-4397-b0b2-1c17039ccfd6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782825428545-e3869b9b-7e2c-4e00-b6eb-e1731d2c05be.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>了解</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782825642584-d34180f0-f5e7-4f0e-90d5-be1aace6d82c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Web服务器开发的概览（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">了解</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782825876035-7e338966-b482-4724-b605-e6275412e072.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node中流Stream概念解析和划分（理解）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782826180776-4f7c9ab9-321e-4d85-93da-3251043a5bc1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node中流Stream--可读流的基本使用过程（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782826353832-c5233cb8-054e-4966-ad18-c7594baac681.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782826363371-fdf3b96e-4726-41f5-b1e1-ac3b12949caf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827345946-679e57d3-1f95-4ea7-ad6a-837469aa8888.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827365888-a1e20389-e076-45e1-b8d4-54a5908546d5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827429035-2fa27128-3e97-4a4e-9775-f951cc31d775.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>highWaterMark:每一次读取多少个字节<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827498796-437079a7-c41f-4968-a3ab-5913a31e57cd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>pause：方法就是暂停，（加上前面的代码就是每读取三个就暂停）。resume:恢复。下面的代码就是每一次读三个后等两秒后再去读。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827614090-8829c2e6-e39b-4a03-9053-f01916afe121.png\" alt=\"\">。</p>\n<p>Node中流Stream--可读流的其他事件监听（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827920506-5928f6ef-9f39-4791-b8d2-08a623ad580a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782827977640-fe96e0e5-325c-4153-bf2f-b86c5e4ea2b6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828000201-fa4c8715-c697-445f-b5d9-590fb8743a73.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828030916-af376a00-9a0e-4827-8200-e7eabc837e2d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node中流Stream--可写流的使用过程**<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>**）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828231512-3b1e110e-1160-4881-9f1a-649460d22b49.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828331261-4b1d44b8-14a0-4cc0-88a8-c52fa23328af.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828428400-0716b81a-9df0-4e91-832d-5ad22fd4ee99.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828644340-ad9dff63-1297-4d61-a76d-946911e63f65.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828693922-89c7ee86-7080-4732-ad91-fcfcb0713992.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node中流Stream--可读流的文件拷贝流操作（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782828999184-e64d9ac1-05cb-4505-ae88-b5d6688dfbeb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782829090362-987015da-22cb-4759-9401-a67803ce6055.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node中流Stream--可读流和可写流之间的pipe方法（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782829144389-3bd14ec8-0873-4434-a1e3-7adaed6a6aa2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782829192921-b4f62d09-600b-469e-a65f-7b8fcdbf5c3b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782829457590-5f279cad-e488-4d12-9d5d-3cf016f2726b.